> gcd x^256 - 1, x^64 - 1
gcd x^256 - 1, x^64 - 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)*(x^4 + 1)*(x^8 + 1)*(x^16 + 1)*(x^32 + 1)
    = x^64 - 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> gcd x^300 - 1, x^100 - 1
gcd x^300 - 1, x^100 - 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)*(x^4 + x^3 + x^2 + x + 1)*(x^4 - x^3 + x^2 - x + 1)*(x^8 - x^6 + x^4 - x^2 + 1)*(x^20 + x^15 + x^10 + x^5 + 1)*(x^20 - x^15 + x^10 - x^5 + 1)*(x^40 - x^30 + x^20 - x^10 + 1)
    = x^100 - 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> gcd x^512 - 1, x^128 - 1
gcd x^512 - 1, x^128 - 1
  = (x - 1)*(x + 1)*(x^2 + 1)*(x^4 + 1)*(x^8 + 1)*(x^16 + 1)*(x^32 + 1)*(x^64 + 1)
    = x^128 - 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
> gcd x^256 - 1, x^255 - 1
gcd x^256 - 1, x^255 - 1
  = x - 1
  check: it divides both exactly, and the cofactors are coprime
  (normalized: integer coefficients without a common factor, leading coefficient positive)
